{"id":"b69949a89b41b967","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-quantum-state.md","title":"Quantum State","display":"df-quantum-state — Quantum State","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-quantum-state","aliases":["28-df-quantum-state","Quantum State","Density Operator"],"display":"df-quantum-state — Quantum State","depends_on":["[[28-df-qubit]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §10.3.2 and remarks following Definition 10.9; density-operator extension","source_printed_pages":"210,214","source_pdf_pages":"236,240","source_statement_verified":false,"source_proof_reviewed":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-quantum-state"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-quantum-state</span><span>Quantum State</span><span>Density Operator</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-quantum-state — Quantum State"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1f087819d10a14c0\" href=\"?note=1f087819d10a14c0\" title=\"28-df-qubit\">28-df-qubit</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §10.3.2 and remarks following Definition 10.9; density-operator extension"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"210,214"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"236,240"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal H_n=(\\mathbb C^2)^{\\otimes n}\">\\(\\mathcal H_n=(\\mathbb C^2)^{\\otimes n}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal H_0=\\mathbb C\">\\(\\mathcal H_0=\\mathbb C\\)</span>，计算基 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|x\\rangle\">\\(|x\\rangle\\)</span> 以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\">\\(x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\)</span> 编号，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1f087819d10a14c0\" href=\"?note=1f087819d10a14c0\" title=\"28-df-qubit\">28-df-qubit</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{End}(\\mathcal H_n)\">\\(\\operatorname{End}(\\mathcal H_n)\\)</span> 为有限维复线性算子集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\in\\operatorname{End}(\\mathcal H_n)\">\\(\\rho\\in\\operatorname{End}(\\mathcal H_n)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dagger\">\\(\\dagger\\)</span> 是共轭转置，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\succeq0\">\\(\\succeq0\\)</span> 由下式定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x=(x_1,\\ldots,x_n)\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\">\\(x=(x_1,\\ldots,x_n)\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\epsilon\\rangle=1\\in\\mathcal H_0\">\\(|\\epsilon\\rangle=1\\in\\mathcal H_0\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"|x\\rangle\\coloneqq\\bigotimes_{i=1}^n|x_i\\rangle\\quad(n\\ge1),\\qquad\\rho\\succeq0\\Longleftrightarrow\\rho=\\rho^\\dagger\\land\\forall v\\in\\mathcal H_n\\;\\langle v,\\rho v\\rangle\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[|x\\rangle\\coloneqq\\bigotimes_{i=1}^n|x_i\\rangle\\quad(n\\ge1),\\qquad\\rho\\succeq0\\Longleftrightarrow\\rho=\\rho^\\dagger\\land\\forall v\\in\\mathcal H_n\\;\\langle v,\\rho v\\rangle\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf U_n\\coloneqq\\{\\psi\\in\\mathcal H_n:\\langle\\psi,\\psi\\rangle=1\\},\\qquad \\mathbf D(\\mathcal H_n)\\coloneqq\\{\\rho\\in\\operatorname{End}(\\mathcal H_n):\\rho\\succeq0,\\ \\operatorname{Tr}(\\rho)=1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf U_n\\coloneqq\\{\\psi\\in\\mathcal H_n:\\langle\\psi,\\psi\\rangle=1\\},\\qquad \\mathbf D(\\mathcal H_n)\\coloneqq\\{\\rho\\in\\operatorname{End}(\\mathcal H_n):\\rho\\succeq0,\\ \\operatorname{Tr}(\\rho)=1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pure}(\\rho)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{rank}(\\rho)=1\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathbf U_n\\ \\rho=|\\psi\\rangle\\langle\\psi|\\quad(\\rho\\in\\mathbf D(\\mathcal H_n)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Pure}(\\rho)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{rank}(\\rho)=1\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathbf U_n\\ \\rho=|\\psi\\rangle\\langle\\psi|\\quad(\\rho\\in\\mathbf D(\\mathcal H_n)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>书主要采用纯态向量；密度算子在这里作为容纳混合证据和一般测量的有限维本地扩展。关于其秩一刻画，迹一与正性保证唯一非零特征值为一，故由谱分解得到归一化向量。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>来源：§10.3.2 and remarks following Definition 10.9; density-operator extension，印刷页 210,214；PDF 页 236,240。原书未定位到本条的完整直接陈述；这是与书中主题相关的本地补充。 本次未完整复核原书证明。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-qubit","status":"resolved","id":"1f087819d10a14c0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-qubit]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-qubit","status":"resolved","id":"1f087819d10a14c0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathcal H_n=(\\mathbb C^2)^{\\otimes n}$，$\\mathcal H_0=\\mathbb C$，计算基 $|x\\rangle$ 以 $x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n$ 编号，见 [[28-df-qubit]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal H_n=(\\mathbb C^2)^{\\otimes n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal H_0=\\mathbb C","display":false},{"tex":"|x\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{End}(\\mathcal H_n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho\\in\\operatorname{End}(\\mathcal H_n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\dagger","display":false},{"tex":"\\succeq0","display":false},{"tex":"x=(x_1,\\ldots,x_n)\\in\\{0,1\\}^n","display":false},{"tex":"|\\epsilon\\rangle=1\\in\\mathcal H_0","display":false},{"tex":"|x\\rangle\\coloneqq\\bigotimes_{i=1}^n|x_i\\rangle\\quad(n\\ge1),\\qquad\\rho\\succeq0\\Longleftrightarrow\\rho=\\rho^\\dagger\\land\\forall v\\in\\mathcal H_n\\;\\langle v,\\rho v\\rangle\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbf U_n\\coloneqq\\{\\psi\\in\\mathcal H_n:\\langle\\psi,\\psi\\rangle=1\\},\\qquad \\mathbf D(\\mathcal H_n)\\coloneqq\\{\\rho\\in\\operatorname{End}(\\mathcal H_n):\\rho\\succeq0,\\ \\operatorname{Tr}(\\rho)=1\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Pure}(\\rho)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{rank}(\\rho)=1\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathbf U_n\\ \\rho=|\\psi\\rangle\\langle\\psi|\\quad(\\rho\\in\\mathbf D(\\mathcal H_n)).","display":true}],"bytes":2111,"backlinks":[{"id":"5f1a82cfa5790c35","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"正算子记号见 [[28-df-quantum-state]]；$\\mu_{E,\\rho}$ 为下式定义的有限概率质量函数。"},{"id":"c994a65ad9a02350","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf{QCirc}_m$、$\\operatorname{QU}$、$\\operatorname{Out}$、$\\operatorname{size}$ 见 [[28-df-quantum-circuit]]；密度算子与接受投影见 [[28-df-quantum-state]]、[[28-df-measurement]]。"},{"id":"b4588e429e73283a","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal G$、$\\mathbf{QGate}_q$ 见 [[28-df-quantum-gate]]；$\\mathcal H_m,\\mathbf D(\\mathcal H_m)$ 见 [[28-df-quantum-state]]。"},{"id":"dec9a25527c3b8b7","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$q\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$；$\\mathcal H_q,\\mathbf D(\\mathcal H_q)$ 见 [[28-df-quantum-state]]。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-166","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"状态空间：[[28-df-qubit]]、[[28-df-quantum-state]]、[[28-df-measurement]]。"}],"outgoing":["1f087819d10a14c0"]}